  "result": "**What it does:** Order utilities — `calcTotal` sums item price×qty, `applyDiscount` applies coded percentage discounts, `averageItemPrice` averages, `formatOrder` renders lines + discounted total.\n\n**Bugs:**\n1. `calcTotal:5` — off-by-one: `i <= items.length` reads `items[items.length]` (undefined) → `undefined.price` throws. Use `i < items.length`.\n2. `averageItemPrice:20` — empty `items` → `0/0 = NaN` (also `calcTotal` throws on empty via bug 1). Guard for `length === 0`.\n3. `applyDiscount` — no validation that `total`/`pct` are sane, and `formatOrder:26` calls `.toFixed` assuming a number; if any item lacks `price`/`qty`, total becomes `NaN`. Minor vs. the above.\n\nBug #1 is critical: every `calcTotal` call throws.",
